            "review_title": "Review at The Backyard",
            "review_text": "Philippe B\n3 contributions\n0\nEat like a Local\nApr 2025 • Family\nExperience an interesting way to your food like the locals. The meat just like the vegetables are delicious and well marinated. The staff is super helpful and friendly even though they don’t speak english. They started the grill for us with the oil and the meat and after that they showed us how they eat everything in combination. The egg cheese sauce is interesting but not to our liking but definitely worth to try. \nThe staff didn’t have the right money to give us our change but went around to the shops in the street to change to smaller bills. \nOverall an amazing experience and worth the money (which is not much) would recommend to everyone who likes to try new things. \nYou can eat inside but we eat on the sidewalk like the others. \nThe tables are a bit to small for an average sized European man so my knees were above the table. It was a bit awkward to sit like that but was only a minor inconvenience.\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2025",
